<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR RATES FALL SLIGHTLY AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR RATES FALL SLIGHTLY AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>fell slightly at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on</p>
<p>Wednesday. The three-month rate was unchanged at 3.20 percent.</p>
<p>				     Sept 25 fix	    Sept 24 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.10 pct		3.11 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.15 pct		3.15 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.35 pct		3.36 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.46 pct		3.47 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.57 pct		3.59 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
